INFO:root:Session ID: 8af2e35c-3026-46b4-9ac9-abd4d7615914, AI Response: Softmax regression, also known as multinomial logistic regression, is a generalization of logistic regression used for multi-class classification problems. It models the probabilities of each class using the softmax function, which converts raw scores (logits) into probabilities that sum to one. The model predicts the class with the highest probability.
